category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgnutls-devel
sdesc: "Lightweight library for embedding webserver in applications (utilities)"
ldesc: "GNU libmicrohttpd is a small C library that is supposed to make it easy to run
an HTTP server as part of another application. GNU GNU Libmicrohttpd is free
software and part of the GNU project."
skip:

homepage: https://www.gnu.org/software/libmicrohttpd/
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later
